---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About · unbeholden.dev"
	description="Who runs Unbeholden, what it runs on, and why the data stays here."
>
	<p class="font-display text-statement mt-masthead mb-10 font-light text-pretty">
		I'm Jakub. I keep my own data and run open source where there is a version worth running.
	</p>
	<div class="text-article">
		<p>
			I have never had a good answer to why I would hand a company my photos and my mail when I do
			not have to. Convenience is the honest answer, and doing it myself has cost less than I
			assumed.
		</p>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6">
			This runs on hardware I own and a rented VPS. I do keep analytics, because I would rather
			know which posts were worth writing, but it is Umami on my own box: no cookies, and nothing
			about you leaves it.
		</p>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6">
			When the thing I need doesn't exist, or exists only as a service someone else can withdraw, I
			write it and publish it here. Usually small, usually specific to one problem.
		</p>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6 mb-12">Prose is CC BY 4.0. Code is CC0/MIT.</p>
	</div>
	<div
		class="border-rule text-nav grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr))] gap-x-8 border-t leading-[1.7]"
	>
		<a href="mailto:hello@unbeholden.dev" class="border-rule border-b py-4"
			>Email<br /><span class="text-faint italic">hello@unbeholden.dev</span></a
		>
		<a href="/feed.xml" class="border-rule text-accent border-b py-4"
			>Feed<br /><span class="text-faint italic">unbeholden.dev/feed.xml</span></a
		>
	</div>
</Layout>
